<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Erro {{ error.code || 500 }}</title>
  </head>
  <body>
    <h1>{{ error.code || 500 }}</h1>
    <p>Ocorreu um erro inesperado no servidor. Tente novamente em instantes.</p>
  </body>
</html>
